    "figure_label": "FIGURE 1",
    "figure_caption": "Proteasome inhibition results in degradation of mutant p53 protein. Immunoblot analysis of p53 level in R273H mutant bearing lung cancer cell line (H1975) and wildtype p53 bearing lung cancer cell line (A549) treated with 100nM Bortezomib for indicated timepoints (A, B). The intensity of p53 was determined by densitometry using ImageJ software and expressed relative to control (C, D). (E) Lung cancer cell line H1975 (p53R273H) was treated with cycloheximide with and without bortezomib. Cell lysates were obtained at indicated timepoints and immunoblotted with indicated antibodies. (F) Detected bands were quantified on image J and plotted relative to 0 time point. Graph shows average of 3 replicates. * = p<0.05, ns = not significant.",
